<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal drains funds at 6.8 pct. [CORRECTED 17:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal drains funds at 6.8 pct. [CORRECTED 17:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to agree with text).</p>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it drained 32.293 billion escudos from the money market at a fixed rate of 6.80 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
